    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any alpine or tundra.\n\nFrostmint grows in tight blue-white clusters beneath snow shelves and along the shaded faces of high crags. Its serrated leaves are cold enough to numb bare fingers, and a freshly crushed sprig gives off the crisp scent of winter air. Mountain travellers steep it into a bitter tea or chew the prepared leaves before crossing exposed ground; either method leaves the breath steaming even in warm air. For 1 hour, you gain resistance to cold damage.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
